### Verificar conflicto de programación por fecha — resultado esperado (200, hasConflict true/false)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getSchedulingConflict
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1001,
  "startDate": "2026-01-15T08:00:00",
  "minDiffTimeInMinutes": 30
}

### Verificar conflicto de programación por horario recurrente — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getSchedulingConflict
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1001,
  "scheduleId": 50,
  "minDiffTimeInMinutes": 30
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getSchedulingConflict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1001,
  "startDate": "2026-01-15T08:00:00"
}

### Sin unitId ni fecha/horario → 400 (validación del controller: unitId y startDate|scheduleId son requeridos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getSchedulingConflict
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minDiffTimeInMinutes": 30
}

### UnitId inexistente o fuera del scope del usuario → 400 (RAISERROR del SP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/getSchedulingConflict
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 999999999,
  "startDate": "2026-01-15T08:00:00"
}
